eels it too."}, {"a": 30.6, "b": 33.25, "at": 1.85, "text": "It takes the corner a little slower in the wake."}]}, {"name": "chase", "v": "chase-2.mp4", "dur": 3.8, "lines": [{"a": 33.4, "b": 37.1, "at": 0.05, "text": "Being close is easy. Getting past is the race.", "amber": "race"}]}, {"name": "question + end", "v": "orbit.mp4", "dur": 6.8, "eng": [[0, 0.32], [3.7, 0.32], [4.3, 0.62]], "lines": [{"a": 37.2, "b": 40.72, "at": 0.1, "text": "So\u2026 dive in the corner, or wait for the straight?"}]}]}